# Nobody sees who calls the handlers. Each makes an object of A or B: the class is asked for in full, and what is neither goes through the construction of any value.
# f4 = row, f5 = name, f6 = both, f7 = held, f2 = A, f3 = B, L0 = A, L1 = B
